  "question": {
    "text": "From a point on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> tangents are drawn to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> such that the chord of contact passes through a fixed point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let the point be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>⇒</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Chord of contact of the hyperbola is <math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Since, this passes through the fixed point&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>"
  }
}